1
00:00:00,059 --> 00:00:03,319
He opened the package and went speechless with joy.

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:06,019
He loves that RV more than I want to admit.

3
00:00:06,299 --> 00:00:09,420
So this year, I looked for something he'd actually appreciate.

4
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:13,759
Not just some gadget that ends up in a drawer. Found a roof cover for the RV.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,199
Protects the roof when it's parked outside all winter.

6
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:17,639
He was genuinely happy.

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:24,659
Not politely happy. Truly happy. For once, I gave him something he actually uses every winter, year after year.

8
00:00:24,719 --> 00:00:28,359
The best gift is the one that shows you get what they care about.
